                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7b3cde7d-13a1-39db-818a-95a0dafde880",
                        "entry_id": "9e480ed0-5b5d-320a-891d-755cc80c5e51",
                        "glosses": [
                            "foutloos, zuiver en zonder enig gebrek"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7f194b48-28f8-48d3-95cb-8d4ece4fd60d",
                                "sense_id": "7b3cde7d-13a1-39db-818a-95a0dafde880",
                                "text": "De drie Britten, nog altijd een stuk meer nerd dan charisma, hadden zich alvast in een soortement lichtgevende kubussen verschanst, wat hun show meteen erg statisch en tikkel steriel maakte. Daardoor vielen songs als ‘Tesselate’ en ‘Nara’, hoe loepzuiver gespeeld ook, nogal dood in de set. Nieuwkomer ‘In cold blood’ toonde zich wel wellustiger."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e1205188-eaee-4210-afaa-5bde21766412",
                                "sense_id": "7b3cde7d-13a1-39db-818a-95a0dafde880",
                                "text": "Het 9-jarige nachtegaaltje Celine Tam uit Hongkong heeft gisteren met haar optreden in America's Got Talent een verpletterende indruk gemaakt. Het schattige meisje, dat vernoemd is naar de Canadese superster Céline Dion, zong loepzuiver My Heart Will Go On van, natuurlijk, haar idool Céline Dion. En daarvoor kreeg ze een staande ovatie en een tsunami positieve reacties op sociale media."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0a9578e1-939c-4e51-8df0-60a7021ab042",
                        "source_entry_id": "9e480ed0-5b5d-320a-891d-755cc80c5e51",
                        "source_sense_id": "7b3cde7d-13a1-39db-818a-95a0dafde880",
                        "target_lang_word": "flawless",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "flawless",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3940a5f9-3d5b-3364-89fe-b259436fd848",
                                        "entry_id": "8bfe3311-f9c3-3d80-bc82-492f437fefb5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Without flaws, defects, or shortcomings; perfect."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "307cd6c6-27ff-4050-92a9-d20e3cc07a07",
                                                "sense_id": "3940a5f9-3d5b-3364-89fe-b259436fd848",
                                                "text": "The pianist’s performance this evening was flawless."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ccbd01a2-1b2b-4b31-b56f-2d4b9345e71d",
                                                "sense_id": "3940a5f9-3d5b-3364-89fe-b259436fd848",
                                                "text": "[W]hen I write of Sacred ſubjects, I had rather a Book of mine ſhould reſemble the Moon, which, though ſhe be but Small, leſs Elevated, and full of Imperfections, lends yet an Uſeful Light to Men, and produces here and there a Motion that obeys a Heavenly Influence; than a Star of the Firſt Magnitude, which though more High, more Vaſt, and more Flawleſs, ſhines only bright enough to make it Self Conſpicuous."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5292684-c9aa-4fb9-92b6-e3c6f16b3eee",
                                                "sense_id": "3940a5f9-3d5b-3364-89fe-b259436fd848",
                                                "text": "Dr. Peyton, a principal physician, and rich in all the attributes that go to constitute high and flawless character, did all that educated judgment and trained skill could do for Henry; but, as the newspapers had said in the beginning, his hurts were past help."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "701e6e05-9ae6-4c62-ba2d-1b64d359463b",
                                                "sense_id": "3940a5f9-3d5b-3364-89fe-b259436fd848",
                                                "text": "Not a single cloud mars the flawless azure; / Not a shadow moves o'er the moveless crops; [...]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b982671d-c72a-4770-a701-8891debdf84d",
                                                "sense_id": "3940a5f9-3d5b-3364-89fe-b259436fd848",
                                                "text": "Then he carefully examined the trunk, going over it with a magnifying glass. He found it intact: the steel bands were flawless; the whole trunk was compact into unity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "96ccbb85-f8e8-4ae2-b5b4-f1ba52481e37",
                                                "sense_id": "3940a5f9-3d5b-3364-89fe-b259436fd848",
                                                "text": "I'm confident our military is ready to fulfill this mission today. Our troops continue to execute complex and dangerous missions far from home with flawless precision, as we've just seen in the Persian Gulf. Our challenge is to retain the ability to do this as we carry out our entire defense strategy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d6b27d2-0427-46aa-822e-259a10f01d9c",
                                                "sense_id": "3940a5f9-3d5b-3364-89fe-b259436fd848",
                                                "text": "City's victory was secured in first-half injury time when Liverpool goalkeeper Simon Mignolet made a hash of his attempt to keep out Alvaro Negredo's chip, ensuring Manuel Pellegrini's side kept their flawless home league record."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "flawless",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f84fece-847d-3ce4-bb1f-c505f7ff5094",
                                        "entry_id": "0cb6a731-95c0-3bd4-a61a-a8d65469df3f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To win a fight against (a player) without losing health."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b65e44d-2a78-4c21-8f5d-fb30e4f5dbd2",
                                                "sense_id": "9f84fece-847d-3ce4-bb1f-c505f7ff5094",
                                                "text": "I got flawlessed again. I'm so bad at this game."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
